abstract: >-
  Gap-3 A^4+B^4=(B+3)^13 toward Baker B0=10^6. v24.4.0 db7a556 closed
  |Λ|≤B^4/A^4 and the B≤10^6 census. v25 wiring at e823a52 / f7bbdc5
  packages hGen (Matveev 2000 Thm 1.4 n=2, ∀α1,α2>1, α2=B+3) and
  hLLL (Bugeaud LLL) into ∀B ¬∃A. One sorry remains:
  matveev_gap3_lower at line 716 in beal-level-26-foundations 4bd15bd.
